# study-hub.html is generated by build-study-hub.py — never hand-edited.
# Its ~570KB `const DATA = {...}` payload sits on a single line, so a textual
# diff is unreadable and a merge conflict is unresolvable by hand.
#   linguist-generated  collapse it in GitHub diffs; exclude from language stats
#   -diff               don't attempt a textual diff
#   merge=ours          on conflict keep the local copy — it's regenerated anyway
# `merge=ours` needs a driver defined per clone (it is not carried by .gitattributes):
#   git config merge.ours.driver true
study-hub.html linguist-generated=true -diff merge=ours
